+        "git-release-check: RELEASE_BOUND BADF-BASELINE-1.0.0",
+        "composition: CURRENT (7a27cff)"
+      ]
+    }
+  ],
+  "non_coverage": [
+    "STALE_EVIDENCE (rewrite) verdicts were exercised only synthetically: the program's rewritten heads (e.g. 7a755d9, c10a22e under #148) were force-pushed away and are not on origin, so history cannot replay them",
+    "the recovery inventory on genuinely dirty state was observed locally during the program (TOPIC RECOVERY_REQUIRED before a push; LOCAL on a mid-rebase residue) but is not committed evidence; the committed runner records are EVIDENCE_ONLY on clean checkouts",
+    "branch-name conformance of landed PR heads (wp/WP-2026-NNNN-<slug>) was observed through the GitHub API at merge time; branches are deleted on merge, so it is not recomputable offline",
+    "tag signing: no signed release ref exists; provenance.signed is recorded, never verified",
+    "landings before GIT-E carry no composition record by construction; their composition_verified: false is the honest reading, not a defect"
+  ]
+}
